{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.qLinearIndependent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.qLinearIndependent","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BorelZagierQouVolumes.lean#L45-L45","doc":"No nontrivial rational relation: a vanishing rational\ncombination forces all three coefficients to vanish. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.volBorromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.volBorromean","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BorelZagierQouVolumes.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.vol52","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.vol52","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BorelZagierQouVolumes.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.vol41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.vol41","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BorelZagierQouVolumes.lean#L40-L40","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\n      **Conjecture (Borel--Zagier for QOU volumes).**\nThe three QOU hyperbolic volumes are $\\mathbb{Q}$-linearly independent.\n\n      The field asserts the conjecture's shape: every *nontrivial*\n      rational combination of the three volumes is non-vanishing.\n      The three volume fields are data pinned by the manuscript's\n      definitions; tying them to formalised values is the remaining\n      refinement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BorelZagierQouVolumes.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BorelZagierQouVolumes","kind":"class","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BorelZagierQouVolumes.lean#L25-L48","doc":"Rational linear independence of QOU hyperbolic volumes (Borel--Zagier)\n\nConjectural class — see [`conj:borel-zagier-qou-volumes`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/archimedean-universe/borel-zagier-qou-volumes.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:borel-zagier-qou-volumes","label":"conj:borel-zagier-qou-volumes","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/borel-zagier-qou-volumes.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}